<fw type="header" place="top">1. Statistik.</fw>
<table xml:id="p115-b1" facs="#f0127-b1" rows="13" cols="4"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Jahre.</cell><cell role="label">Einwohner.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene.</cell><cell role="label">in Procenten.</cell></row><row><cell>1794</cell><cell>14279</cell><cell>342</cell><cell>2,39</cell></row><row><cell>1795</cell><cell>14394</cell><cell>440</cell><cell>3,05</cell></row><row><cell>1796</cell><cell>14455</cell><cell>476</cell><cell>3,29</cell></row><row><cell>1797</cell><cell>14475</cell><cell>538</cell><cell>3,70</cell></row><row><cell>1798</cell><cell>14597</cell><cell>469</cell><cell>3,21</cell></row><row><cell>1799</cell><cell>14765</cell><cell>405</cell><cell>2,74</cell></row><row><cell>1800</cell><cell>14396</cell><cell>980</cell><cell>6,80</cell></row><row><cell>1801</cell><cell>14516</cell><cell>462</cell><cell>3,18</cell></row><row><cell>1802</cell><cell>14699</cell><cell>492</cell><cell>3,34</cell></row><row><cell>1803</cell><cell>14900</cell><cell>426</cell><cell>2,86</cell></row><row><cell>1804</cell><cell>15204</cell><cell>365</cell><cell>2,40</cell></row><row><cell>1794-1804</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>3,36</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p115-b2"><lb n="2" facs="#f0127-l2"/>Das Verhältnis der Sterblichkeit des Fürstenthums zu den übrigen <lb n="3" facs="#f0127-l3"/>thüringischen Staaten ist kein günstiges, dagegen ein mittleres in Bezug auf <lb n="4" facs="#f0127-l4"/>andere europäische Länder, wie die folgenden Zusammenstellungen ausweisen. <lb n="5" facs="#f0127-l5"/>Es kommt nämlich ein Sterbefall in:</p>
<list xml:id="p115-b3" facs="#f0127-b3"><item><lb n="6" facs="#f0127-l6"/><placeName ref="#place-sachsen-altenburg">S.-Altenburg</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . auf 34,72 Einwohner.</item><item><placeName ref="#place-fuerstenthum-reuss-juengerer-linie">Reuß j. L.</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 36,36 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-sachsen-coburg">S.-Coburg</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 41,08 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-sachsen-gotha">S.-Gotha</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 41,32 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-sachsen-weimar">S.-Weimar</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 41,66 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-sachsen-meiningen">S.-<lb n="7" facs="#f0127-l7"/>Meiningen</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 43,10 "</item><item><lb n="8" facs="#f0127-l8"/><placeName ref="#place-fuerstenthum-schwarzburg-rudolstadt">Schwarzburg-Rudolstadt</placeName> . . . . . . . . " 44,44 "</item><item><lb n="9" facs="#f0127-l9"/><placeName ref="#place-fuerstenthum-schwarzburg-sondershausen">Schwarzburg-Sondershausen</placeName> . . . . . . . " 45,04 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-oesterreich">Oesterreich</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 29,72 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-wuertemberg">Würtemberg</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 31,99 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-preussen">Preußen</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 33,85 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-sachsen">Sachsen</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 34,12 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-hannover">Hannover</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 40,89 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-frankreich">Frankreich</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 41,13 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-daenemark">Dänemark</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 45,00 "</item><item><placeName ref="#place-norwegen">Norwegen</placeName> . . . . . . . . . . . . . . " 51,77 "</item></list>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p115-b4" facs="#f0127-b4"><lb n="10" facs="#f0127-l10"/>Gestorbene nach dem Geschlecht:</ab>
<table xml:id="p115-b5" facs="#f0127-b5" rows="6" cols="9"><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">Procente der</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell cols="2" role="label">Procente der</cell></row><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">männl.</cell><cell role="label">weibl.</cell><cell role="label">m. Bev.</cell><cell role="label">w. Bev.</cell><cell role="label">männl.</cell><cell role="label">weibl.</cell><cell role="label">m. Bev.</cell><cell rows="2" role="label">w. Bev.</cell></row><row role="label"><cell role="label">Durchschn. von 1858-67</cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-gera">Bezirk Gera</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-schleiz">Bezirk Schleiz</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell></row><row><cell></cell><cell>520,1</cell><cell>468,5</cell><cell>2,87</cell><cell>2,59</cell><cell>407,3</cell><cell>375,7</cell><cell>3,08</cell><cell>2,76</cell></row><row><cell>Durchschn. von 1858-67</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Bez. Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName>.</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell>Fürstenthum.</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell></cell><cell>325,0</cell><cell>309,3</cell><cell>3,03</cell><cell>2,62</cell><cell>1256,4</cell><cell>1156,8</cell><cell>2,99</cell><cell>2,75</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p115-b6"><lb n="21" facs="#f0127-l21"/>Wie in allen anderen Staaten, so wird auch hier im Einzelnen und im <lb n="22" facs="#f0127-l22"/>Ganzen das Gesetz bestätigt, daß auf Seiten der männlichen Bevölkerung die <lb n="23" facs="#f0127-l23"/>Sterblichkeit größer ist als auf Seiten der weiblichen. Für das von Lebens=</p>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom">8*</fw>
</div></body></text>
